Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "123" into source.
Keep a shared sourcevalue as 0.
Keep a shared length as 0.
Keep a shared prefix as 0.
Keep a shared made as 0.
Keep a shared back as 0.
Keep a shared best as 0.
Keep a shared bestgap as 0.
Keep a shared chosen as 0.
To peel from value (a whole number).
If value is 0, return.
The digit is value modulo 10.
Set back to back times 10 plus digit.
Peel from value divided by 10.

To reflect from seed (a whole number) with size (a whole number).
The local is seed.
If size modulo 2 is 1, set local to local divided by 10.
Set back to 0.
Peel from local.
The scale is 1.
The limit is size divided by 2.
For every step from 1 to limit, set scale to scale times 10.
Set made to seed times scale plus back.

To score from value (a whole number).
If value is sourcevalue, return.
The diff is value minus sourcevalue.
If diff is less than 0, set diff to 0 minus diff.
If chosen is 0, set best to value, set bestgap to diff, set chosen to 1, return.
If diff is less than bestgap, set best to value, set bestgap to diff, return.
If diff is bestgap and value is less than best, set best to value.

The last is the last position of source.
Set length to last plus 1.
The middle is (length plus 1) divided by 2.
For every spot from 0 to middle minus 1.
The digit is the digit value of character spot of source.
Set prefix to prefix times 10 plus digit.

For every spot from 0 to last.
The digit is the digit value of character spot of source.
Set sourcevalue to sourcevalue times 10 plus digit.

Reflect from prefix minus 1 with length.
Score from made.
Reflect from prefix with length.
Score from made.
Reflect from prefix plus 1 with length.
Score from made.
The lower is 1.
For every step from 1 to length minus 1, set lower to lower times 10.
Subtract 1 from lower.
Score from lower.
The upper is 1.
For every step from 1 to length, set upper to upper times 10.
Add 1 to upper.
Score from upper.

Show best.
